# "Target legendary creature": Bot2's Ornithopter (not legendary) and Karakas itself (a legendary land, not a creature) are
# refused as targets, while Bot2's Cecil, Dark Knight (a legendary creature, the positive control) is bounced to its owner's
# hand. Both abilities cost {T}, so after the bounce Karakas is tapped and cannot also add {W} (refusal); the mana ability
# works on its own on turn 5.

[Bot1 Deck]
Karakas
Island x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Cecil, Dark Knight
Ornithopter
Swamp x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Karakas.Play
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Cecil, Dark Knight.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Karakas.Activate(Ability: Return; Ornithopter)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Karakas.Activate(Ability: Return; Karakas)
Bot1.Battlefield.Karakas.Activate(Ability: Return; Cecil, Dark Knight)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Hand.Count = 6
! Bot1.Battlefield.Karakas.Activate(Ability: Add)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Karakas.Activate(Ability: Add)

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana = {W}
Bot2.Battlefield = Swamp; Ornithopter
